                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Second Meeting of the Working Group Participating in
                        the Washington Exploratory Talks on Security, July</hi> 14, 1948</p>
                <p>Mr. Reber presented a tentative breakdown of an agenda constructed from the
                    records of the five meetings of the ambassadorial group. The working group,
                    before turning its attention to an examination of this agenda, discussed the
                    current military talks in London, referring in particular to the question of
                    publicity and the “non-member” character of United States participation. The
                    memorandum of this meeting, not printed, is in the Department of State files,
                    840.20/7–1448.</p>
            </div>
